{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb51DYLqrvGK8kV1Nff","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Don't remove it yet. The evidence is too weak to support that decision, and keeping the feature at 10% costs little.**\n\n**Why the 4% isn't trustworthy**\n- **Missing data:** Logging was down for 5 of 14 days (36% of the window). If the 4% counts only logged events, it's a floor. The true figure could be meaningfully higher, and we don't know by how much.\n- **No benchmark:** \"Low\" compared to what? Nobody seems to have set a target, such as a comparable feature's two-week adoption or a pre-agreed threshold.\n- **Wrong metric:** \"Tried it\" measures curiosity, not value. The real questions are whether people came back, kept the scheduled events, and saved time.\n- **Unclear denominator:** 4% of all 10% of users, or of those who actually saw the entry point? Poor discoverability would look the same as low demand.\n\n**What I'd do**\n1. **Recover the data.** Auto-scheduled events likely exist in the primary database, so you can reconstruct usage for the outage days without the pipeline. Then fix and monitor the pipeline.\n2. **Agree on success criteria now.** Define adoption, repeat use and a downstream outcome (for example, fewer reschedules), plus a decision date.\n3. **Look at the funnel:** saw it, tried it, completed it, used it again within 7 days. That shows where users drop off.\n4. **Add qualitative signal.** Talk to a handful of users who tried it, and some who didn't.\n5. **Extend the test 2–3 weeks** at 10% with clean data, then decide to expand, iterate or remove.\n\n**Message to the team lead:** \"We may well be right to cut it, but five days of missing data means we can't tell yet. A short extension gets us a defensible answer.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3456,"cache_read_input_tokens":4979,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3456},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31d7e7aa-e3f8-4282-ad64-cda87da7ae35","uuid":"63cbb5ae-d45f-490b-a121-14269f49d167","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:13:50.958Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb4zsTnuwxA34EgsWpW"}
